STAGE 21 EVIDENCE REVIEW — VERIFIED
TX submission action pointer is at [queue + 0x20].
legacyDequeue calls the five-argument action callback, tests EAX, and uses nonzero EAX as the number of packet slots progressed.
listDequeue calls the same action pointer, adds EAX to its dequeued total, and subtracts EAX from the remaining request count.
The callback therefore returns a packet count, not an IOReturn error status. kIOReturnNotReady and kIOReturnBadArgument must not be returned from these action callbacks.
The separate three-argument query-free-space handler at [queue + 0xF0] is not the TX submission action.

